  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nLet's solve with the help of BODMAS Rule:\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1) ÷, +, -, ×, =\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n= __**176 ÷ 4**__ + 9 - 3 × 13 = 14\n\n= 44 + 9 - __**3 × 13**__ = 14\n\n= __**44 + 9**__ - 39 = 14\n\n= __**53 - 39**__ = 14\n\n= 14 = 14\n\n= **LHS = RHS**\n\n2) -, ×, +, ÷, =\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n= 176 - 4 × 9 +** 3 ÷ 13** = 14\n\n= 176 -__** 4 × 9 **__+ 0.230 = 14\n\n= __**176**__ - 36 __**+ 0.230**__ = 14\n\n= **176.23 - 36** = 14\n\n= 140.23 ≠ 14\n\n= **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) +, -, ÷, ×, =\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n= 176 + 4 - __**9 ÷ 3**__ × 13 = 14\n\n= 176 + 4 - __**3 × 13**__ = 14\n\n= __**176 + 4**__ - 39 = 14\n\n= __**180 - 39**__ = 14\n\n= 141 ≠ 14\n\n= **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) ×, +, ÷, -, =\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n= 176 × 4 + __**9 ÷ 3**__ - 13 = 14 \n\n= __**176 × 4 **__+ 3 - 13 = 14\n\n= __**704 + 3**__ - 13 = 14\n\n= __**707 - 13**__ = 14\n\n= 694 ≠ 14\n\n= **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
